      "id": "https://newatlas.com/diet-nutrition/mushroom-peptides-no-extra-salt/",
      "url": "https://newatlas.com/diet-nutrition/mushroom-peptides-no-extra-salt/",
      "title": "Mushroom peptide makes salt taste 70% saltier – and it's good for you",
      "content_html": "<p><img alt=\"Imagine if you could cut your salt intake by up to 70% and not have to sacrifice flavor? Scientists are working on it\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/be5062c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5382x3588+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F86%2F65%2F149667a2447cb89d0b9703d065bc%2Fdepositphotos-168854380-xl.jpg\"/><p>Food is one of the true pleasures of life, and often part of our enjoyment comes from flavors enhanced by salt. But too much of a good thing can be bad. Scientists have uncovered a promising workaround, using naturally derived peptides that make salt taste saltier, greatly reducing the amount we need to add to food for the same taste.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/diet-nutrition/mushroom-peptides-no-extra-salt/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://refractor.io/diet-nutrition/\">Diet &amp; Nutrition</a>, <a href=\"https://refractor.io/health-wellbeing/\">Wellness and Healthy Living</a>, <a href=\"https://refractor.io/medical/\">Body and Mind</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/blood-pressure/\" rel=\"tag\">Blood Pressure</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/hypertension/\" rel=\"tag\">Hypertension</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/food/\" rel=\"tag\">Food</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/food+technology/\" rel=\"tag\">Food technology</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/heart-health/\" rel=\"tag\">Heart health</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/mushrooms/\" rel=\"tag\">Mushrooms</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/salt/\" rel=\"tag\">Salt</a></p></p>",
